{
  "_comment": "Golden cases for api/internal/milestonelanes.Derive (PRD #1353). Each case feeds a set of run-message frames, the frozen milestone list, the in-progress id set, and a `now` instant into Derive and asserts the derived per-milestone live lanes. now is 2026-09-19T12:00:00Z; laneFreshWindow is 10m, so the staleness backstop cuts at 2026-09-19T11:50:00Z. A dispatch frame is a lead-lane tool_use named 'Agent' whose payload.id is the subagent's agent_instance and whose input.description carries the leading [<id>] milestone tag; a lane frame is a subagent tool_use carrying that agent_instance; a completion is a lead-lane tool_result whose payload.tool_use_id == the agent_instance. Asserted from Go (milestonelanes/derive_test.go).",
